    source: 'Marking scheme 2025 HL, Section A Compréhension Écrite 1 Q4(a) (‘Des hauts et des bas’ = 5 Marks; ‘Des hauts’/‘Des bas’ = 2 Marks each); scheme front-matter Penalties point 2 ‘Inappropriate quotation’ (max minus 1 Mark)',
    marks: 5,
